<title>HONG KONG: Tenaga Yankee roadshow seen next week.</title>
<headline>Tenaga Yankee roadshow seen next week.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-04-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Malaysian electric utility Tenaga Nasional will start a roadshow for its upcoming Yankee bond next week, bankers said.</p>
<p>The issue is expected to be at least US$400 million in size.</p>
<p>Union Bank of Switzerland's Labuan branch is lead manager. Credit Suise Labuan and DCB Holdings Labuan are co-lead managers.</p>
<p>Standard and Poor's Corp recently affirmed Tenaga Nasional's A-plus local and foreign currency ratings. It revised the company's outlook to stable from positive.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843-6371</p>
